@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

# USERS — drizzle adapter

### Listar tudo
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&perPage=5

### Sem paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?paginate=false

# FILTROS — root columns

### Exato (implícito)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[email]=ana@acme.com

### Exato (explícito)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[email][eq]=ana@acme.com

### Diferente
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[name][ne]=admin

### Like / ILike (Drizzle: contains; o adapter envolve com %)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[email][like]=acme

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[email][ilike]=ACME

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[name][notLike]=spam

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[name][notIlike]=DELETED

### Comparação por data
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[createdAt][gt]=2024-01-01

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[createdAt][gte]=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[createdAt][lt]=2026-01-01

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[createdAt][lte]=2026-12-31

### IN / NOT IN
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[email][in]=ana@acme.com,bia@acme.com

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[email][notIn]=spam@example.com

### NULL / BETWEEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[companyId][isNull]=true

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[companyId][isNull]=false

GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[createdAt][between]=2024-01-01,2025-12-31

# ORDENAÇÃO

### Simples
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?sort=name

### Descendente
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?sort=-createdAt

### Múltipla
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?sort=name,-email

# CAMPOS

### Seleção de campos (root.id é auto-injetado pelo adapter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?fields=name,email

### Campos + paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?fields=id,name,email&page=1&perPage=3

# INCLUDES — Drizzle adapter

### Include 1:1 (company)
### Resultado: rows como { user: {...}, company: {...} | null }
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?includes=company

### Include 1:N (posts) — ATIVA TWO-PHASE PAGINATION
### data.length === perPage (sem inflação por linhas joinadas), posts é array
### Resultado: rows como { user: {...}, posts: [...] }
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?includes=posts&page=1&perPage=2

### Múltiplos includes (1:1 + 1:N juntos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?includes=company,posts&page=1&perPage=3

# COMBINAÇÕES

### Filter + sort + fields + page (caminho feliz)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[createdAt][gte]=2024-01-01&sort=-createdAt&fields=id,name,email,createdAt&page=1&perPage=10

### Filter + includes 1:N (two-phase + filter no root)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[email][ilike]=acme&includes=posts&page=1&perPage=5

# ERROS ESPERADOS — confirmam contratos do adapter

### ORDER BY em coluna de relação 'many' → 400 Bad Request
### Mensagem: DrizzleAdapter: ORDER BY a column from 'many' relation "posts" is not supported. ...
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?sort=-posts.title

### Filter em campo não whitelistado → 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filter[password][eq]=anything
